<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38869.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38869.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.38869, versus 1.38779 on Friday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.40591   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	8.11689   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	159.311   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.848833   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.83908   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    16.9504   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     49.6700   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.92222   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     9.16119   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah   n/a     (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	2432.10   (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2359.02   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.420162   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.70433   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  10.0986   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.20064   (4.25788)</p>
<p> S.A. Rand	     n/a     (0.80200)</p>
